"verse": 1,
"ahnika": "a23",
"context": "## tal-a23-p01 (23.1-23.10)\n[and]-:C23 atha śrītantrāloke trayoviṃśatitamamāhnikam athābhiṣekasya vidhiḥ kathyate pārameśvaraḥ yaiṣā putrakadīkṣoktā gurusādhakayorapi / saivādhikāriṇī bhogyatattvayuktimatī kramāt svabhyastajñāninaṃ santaṃ bubhūṣumatha bhāvinam / yogyaṃ jñātvā svādhikāraṃ gurustasmai samarpayet yo naivaṃ veda naivāsāvabhiṣikto@pi daiśikaḥ / samayyādikrameṇeti śrīmatkāmika ucyate yo na vedādhvasandhānaṃ ṣoḍhā bāhyāntarasthitam / sa gururmocayenneti siddhayogīśvarīmate sarvalakṣaṇahīno@pi jñānavān gururiṣyate / jñānaprādhānyamevoktamiti śrīkacabhārgave padavākyapramāṇajñaḥ śivabhaktyekatatparaḥ / samastaśivaśāstrārthaboddhā kāruṇiko guruḥ na svayaṃbhūstasya coktaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ parameśinā / abhakto jīvitadhiyā kurvannīśānadhiṣṭhitaḥ paścātmanā svayaṃbhūṣṇurnādhikārī sa kutracit / bhasmāṅkuro vratisuto duḥśīlātanayastathā kuṇḍo golaśca te duṣṭā uktaṃ devyākhyayāmale / punarbhūścānyaliṅgo yaḥ punaḥ śaive pratiṣṭhitaḥ\n## tal-a23-p01–p11 — ahnika 23\n**SUMMARY.** [and]-:C23 atha śrītantrāloke trayoviṃśatitamamāhnikam athābhiṣekasya vidhiḥ kathyate pārameśvaraḥ yaiṣā putrakadīkṣoktā gurusādhakayorapi / saivādhikāriṇī bhogyatattvayuktimatī kramāt svabhyastajñāninaṃ santaṃ bubhūṣumatha bhāvinam / yogyaṃ jñātvā svādhikāraṃ gurustasmai samarpayet yo naivaṃ veda naivāsāvabhiṣikto@pi daiśikaḥ / samayyādikrameṇeti śrīmatkāmika ucyate yo na vedādhvasandhānaṃ ṣoḍhā bāhyāntarasthitam / sa gururmocayenneti siddhayogīśvarīmate sarvalakṣaṇahīno@pi jñānavān gururiṣyate / jñānaprādhānyamevoktamiti śrīkacabhārgave padavākyapramāṇajñaḥ śivabhaktyekatatparaḥ / samastaśivaśāstrārthaboddhā kāruṇiko guruḥ na svayaṃbhūstasya coktaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ parameśinā / abhakto jīvitadhiyā kurvannīśānadhiṣṭhitaḥ paścātmanā svayaṃbhūṣṇurnādhikārī sa kutracit / bhasmāṅkuro vratisuto duḥśīlātanayastathā kuṇḍo golaśca te duṣṭā uktaṃ devyākhyayāmale / punarbhūścānyaliṅgo yaḥ punaḥ śaive pratiṣṭhitaḥ [and]-śrīpūrvaśāstre na tveṣa niyamaḥ ko@pi coditaḥ / yathārthatattvasaṃghajñastathā śiṣye prakāśakaḥ yaḥ punaḥ sarvatattvāni vettītyādi ca lakṣaṇam / yogacāre ca yadyatra tantre coditamācaret tathaiva siddhaye seyamājñeti kila varṇitam / yastu karmitayācāryastatra kāṇādivarjanam yataḥ kārakasāmagryātkarmaṇo nādhikaḥ kvacit / devyā yāmalaśāstre ca kāñcyādiparivarjanam taddṛṣṭadoṣātkrodhādeḥ samyakjñātaryasau kutaḥ / guravastu svayaṃbhvādi varjyaṃ yadyāmalādiṣu karmyabhiprāyataḥ sarvaṃ taditi vyācacakṣire / ato deśakulācāradehalakṣaṇakalpanām anādṛtyaiva saṃpūrṇajñānaṃ kuryādgururgurum / prāgvatsaṃpūjya hutvā ca śrāvayitvā cikīrṣitam tato@bhiṣiñcettaṃ śiṣyaṃ catuḥṣaṣṭyā tataḥ sakṛt / tanmantrarasatoyena pūrvoktavidhinā guruḥ vibhavena suvistīrṇaṃ tatastasmai vadetsvakam / sarvaṃ kartavyasāraṃ yacchāstrāṇāṃ paramaṃ rahaḥ anugrāhyāstvayā śiṣyāḥ śivaśaktipracoditāḥ / uktaṃ jñānottare caitadbrāhmaṇāḥ kṣatriyā viśaḥ [and]-napuṃsakāḥ striyaḥ śūdrā ye cānye@pi tadarthinaḥ / te dīkṣāyāṃ na mīmāṃsyā jñānakāle vicārayet jñānamūlo guruḥ proktaḥ saptasatrīṃ pravartayet / dīkṣā vyākhyā kṛpā maitrī śāstracintā śivaikatā annādidānamityetatpālayetsaptasatrakam / abhiṣekavidhau cāsmai karaṇīkhaṭikādikam sarvopakaraṇavrātamarpaṇīyaṃ vipaścite / so@bhiṣikto guruṃ paścāddakṣiṇābhiḥ prapūjayet jñānahīno guruḥ karmī svādhikāraṃ samarpya no / dīkṣādyadhikṛtiṃ kuryādvinā tasyājñayā punaḥ ityevaṃ śrāvayetso@pi namaskṛtyābhinandayet / tataḥ prabhṛtyasau pūrvo gurustyaktādhikārakaḥ yathecchaṃ vicaredvyākhyādīkṣādau yantraṇojjhitaḥ / kurvanna bādhyate yasmāddīpāddīpavadīdṛśaḥ santāno nādhikārasya cyavo@kurvanna bādhyate / prāk ca kurvanvihanyeta siddhātantre taducyate yathārthamupadeśaṃ tu kurvannācārya ucyate / na cāvajñā kriyākāle saṃsāroddharaṇaṃ prati na dīkṣeta guruḥ śiṣyaṃ tattvayuktastu garvataḥ / yo@sya syānnarake vāsa iha ca vyādhito bhavet [and]-prāptābhiṣekaḥ sa guruḥ ṣaṇmāsānmantrapaddhatim / sarvāṃ tantroditāṃ dhyāyejjapeccātanmayatvataḥ yadaiva tanmayībhūtastadā vīryamupāgataḥ / chindyātpāśāṃstato yatnaṃ kuryāttanmayatāsthitau hṛccakrādutthitā sūkṣmā śaśisphaṭikasaṃnibhā / lekhākārā nādarūpā praśāntā cakrapaṅktigā dvādaśānte nirūḍhā sā sauṣumne tripathāntare / tatra hṛccakramāpūrya japenmantraṃ jvalatprabham cakṣurlomādirandhraughavahajjvālaurvasaṃnibham / yāvacchāntaśikhākīrṇaṃ viśvājyapravilāpakam tadājyadhārāsaṃtṛptamānābhikuharāntaram / evaṃ mantrā mokṣadāḥ syurdīptā buddhāḥ sunirmalāḥ mūlakandanabhonābhihṛtkaṇṭhālikatālugam / ardhendurodhikānādatadantavyāpiśaktigam samanonmanaśuddhātmaparacakrasamāśritam / yatra yatra japeccakre samastavyastabhedanāt tatra tatra mahāmantra iti devyākhyayāmale / vidyāvratamidaṃ proktaṃ mantravīryaprasiddhaye tacca tādātmyameveti yaduktaṃ spandaśāsane / tadākramya balaṃ mantrāḥ sarvajñabalaśālinaḥ [and]-pravartante@dhikārāya karaṇānīva dehinām / kṛtavidyāvrataḥ paścāddīkṣāvyākhyādi sarvataḥ kuryādyogyeṣu śiṣyeṣu nāyogyeṣu kadācana / rahasye yojayedvipraṃ parīkṣya viparītataḥ ācārācchaktimapyeva nānyathetyūrmiśāsane / nityādyalpālpakaṃ kuryādyaduktaṃ brahmayāmale cīrṇavidyāvrataḥ sarvaṃ manasā vā smaretpriye / dehasaṃbandhasaṃchannasārvajñyo dambhabhājanam avidandīkṣamāṇo@pi na duṣyeddaiśikaḥ kvacit / jñātvā tvayogyatāṃ nainaṃ dīkṣeta pratyavāyitām buddhvā jñāne śāstrasiddhigurutvādau ca taṃ punaḥ / bhūya eva parīkṣeta tattadaucityaśālinam tatra tatra niyuñjīta natu jātu viparyayāt / nanu tadvastvayogyasya tatrecchā jāyate kutaḥ tadīśādhiṣṭhitecchaiva yogyatāmasya sūcayet / satyaṃ kāpi prabuddhāsāvicchā rūḍhiṃ na gacchati vidyudvatpāpaśīlasya yathā pāpāpavarjane / rūḍhyarūḍhī tadicchāyā api śaṃbhuprasādataḥ aprarūḍhatathecchākastata eva na bhājanam / yaḥ samyagjñānamādāya guruviśvāsavarjitaḥ [and]-lokaṃ viplāvayennāsmiñjñāte vijñānamarpayet / ajñāte@pi punarjñāte vijñānaharaṇaṃ caret punaḥpunaryadā jñāto viśvāsaparivarjitaḥ / tadā tamagrato dhyāyetsphurantaṃ candrasūryavat tato nijahṛdambhojabodhāmbarataloditām / svarbhānumalināṃ dhyāyedvāmāṃ śaktiṃ vimohanīm vāmācārakrameṇaināṃ niḥsṛtāṃ sādhyagāminīm / cintayitvā tayā grastaprakāśaṃ taṃ vicintayet anena kramayogena mūḍhabuddherdurātmanaḥ / vijñān