"context": "## tal-a23-p01 (23.1-23.10)\n[and]-:C23 atha śrītantrāloke trayoviṃśatitamamāhnikam athābhiṣekasya vidhiḥ kathyate pārameśvaraḥ yaiṣā putrakadīkṣoktā gurusādhakayorapi / saivādhikāriṇī bhogyatattvayuktimatī kramāt svabhyastajñāninaṃ santaṃ bubhūṣumatha bhāvinam / yogyaṃ jñātvā svādhikāraṃ gurustasmai samarpayet yo naivaṃ veda naivāsāvabhiṣikto@pi daiśikaḥ / samayyādikrameṇeti śrīmatkāmika ucyate yo na vedādhvasandhānaṃ ṣoḍhā bāhyāntarasthitam / sa gururmocayenneti siddhayogīśvarīmate sarvalakṣaṇahīno@pi jñānavān gururiṣyate / jñānaprādhānyamevoktamiti śrīkacabhārgave padavākyapramāṇajñaḥ śivabhaktyekatatparaḥ / samastaśivaśāstrārthaboddhā kāruṇiko guruḥ na svayaṃbhūstasya coktaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ parameśinā / abhakto jīvitadhiyā kurvannīśānadhiṣṭhitaḥ paścātmanā svayaṃbhūṣṇurnādhikārī sa kutracit / bhasmāṅkuro vratisuto duḥśīlātanayastathā kuṇḍo golaśca te duṣṭā uktaṃ devyākhyayāmale / punarbhūścānyaliṅgo yaḥ punaḥ śaive pratiṣṭhitaḥ\n## tal-a23-p01–p11 — ahnika 23\n**SUMMARY.** [and]-:C23 atha śrītantrāloke trayoviṃśatitamamāhnikam athābhiṣekasya vidhiḥ kathyate pārameśvaraḥ yaiṣā putrakadīkṣoktā gurusādhakayorapi / saivādhikāriṇī bhogyatattvayuktimatī kramāt svabhyastajñāninaṃ santaṃ bubhūṣumatha bhāvinam / yogyaṃ jñātvā svādhikāraṃ gurustasmai samarpayet yo naivaṃ veda naivāsāvabhiṣikto@pi daiśikaḥ / samayyādikrameṇeti śrīmatkāmika ucyate yo na vedādhvasandhānaṃ ṣoḍhā bāhyāntarasthitam / sa gururmocayenneti siddhayogīśvarīmate sarvalakṣaṇahīno@pi jñānavān gururiṣyate / jñānaprādhānyamevoktamiti śrīkacabhārgave padavākyapramāṇajñaḥ śivabhaktyekatatparaḥ / samastaśivaśāstrārthaboddhā kāruṇiko guruḥ na svayaṃbhūstasya coktaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ parameśinā / abhakto jīvitadhiyā kurvannīśānadhiṣṭhitaḥ paścātmanā svayaṃbhūṣṇurnādhikārī sa kutracit / bhasmāṅkuro vratisuto duḥśīlātanayastathā kuṇḍo golaśca te duṣṭā uktaṃ devyākhyayāmale / punarbhūścānyaliṅgo yaḥ punaḥ śaive pratiṣṭhitaḥ [and]-śrīpūrvaśāstre na tveṣa niyamaḥ ko@pi coditaḥ / yathārthatattvasaṃghajñastathā śiṣye pr