"ahnika": "a23",
"context": "## tal-a23-p03 (23.21-23.30)\n[and]-napuṃsakāḥ striyaḥ śūdrā ye cānye@pi tadarthinaḥ / te dīkṣāyāṃ na mīmāṃsyā jñānakāle vicārayet jñānamūlo guruḥ proktaḥ saptasatrīṃ pravartayet / dīkṣā vyākhyā kṛpā maitrī śāstracintā śivaikatā annādidānamityetatpālayetsaptasatrakam / abhiṣekavidhau cāsmai karaṇīkhaṭikādikam sarvopakaraṇavrātamarpaṇīyaṃ vipaścite / so@bhiṣikto guruṃ paścāddakṣiṇābhiḥ prapūjayet jñānahīno guruḥ karmī svādhikāraṃ samarpya no / dīkṣādyadhikṛtiṃ kuryādvinā tasyājñayā punaḥ ityevaṃ śrāvayetso@pi namaskṛtyābhinandayet / tataḥ prabhṛtyasau pūrvo gurustyaktādhikārakaḥ yathecchaṃ vicaredvyākhyādīkṣādau yantraṇojjhitaḥ / kurvanna bādhyate yasmāddīpāddīpavadīdṛśaḥ santāno nādhikārasya cyavo@kurvanna bādhyate / prāk ca kurvanvihanyeta siddhātantre taducyate yathārthamupadeśaṃ tu kurvannācārya ucyate / na cāvajñā kriyākāle saṃsāroddharaṇaṃ prati na dīkṣeta guruḥ śiṣyaṃ tattvayuktastu garvataḥ / yo@sya syānnarake vāsa iha ca vyādhito bhavet\n"
},
