"context": "## tal-a23-p05 (23.41-23.50)\n[and]-pravartante@dhikārāya karaṇānīva dehinām / kṛtavidyāvrataḥ paścāddīkṣāvyākhyādi sarvataḥ kuryādyogyeṣu śiṣyeṣu nāyogyeṣu kadācana / rahasye yojayedvipraṃ parīkṣya viparītataḥ ācārācchaktimapyeva nānyathetyūrmiśāsane / nityādyalpālpakaṃ kuryādyaduktaṃ brahmayāmale cīrṇavidyāvrataḥ sarvaṃ manasā vā smaretpriye / dehasaṃbandhasaṃchannasārvajñyo dambhabhājanam avidandīkṣamāṇo@pi na duṣyeddaiśikaḥ kvacit / jñātvā tvayogyatāṃ nainaṃ dīkṣeta pratyavāyitām buddhvā jñāne śāstrasiddhigurutvādau ca taṃ punaḥ / bhūya eva parīkṣeta tattadaucityaśālinam tatra tatra niyuñjīta natu jātu viparyayāt / nanu tadvastvayogyasya tatrecchā jāyate kutaḥ tadīśādhiṣṭhitecchaiva yogyatāmasya sūcayet / satyaṃ kāpi prabuddhāsāvicchā rūḍhiṃ na gacchati vidyudvatpāpaśīlasya yathā pāpāpavarjane / rūḍhyarūḍhī tadicchāyā api śaṃbhuprasādataḥ aprarūḍhatathecchākastata eva na bhājanam / yaḥ samyagjñānamādāya guruviśvāsavarjitaḥ\n"
},
