"ahnika": "a23",
"context": "## tal-a23-p10 (23.91-23.100)\n[and]-upadeśastvayaṃ mandamadhyaśakternijāṃ kramāt / śaktiṃ jvalayituṃ proktaḥ sā hyevaṃ jājvalītyalam dṛḍhānurāgasubhagasaṃrambhābhogabhāginaḥ / svollāsi smarasarvasyaṃ dārḍhyāyānyatra dṛśyate nanveṣa kasmāddṛṣṭāntaḥ kimetenāśubhaṃ kṛtam / citspandaḥ sarvago bhinnādupādheḥ sa tathā tathā bhavetko@pi tirobhūtaḥ punarunmukhito@pi san / vināpi daiśikātprāgvatsvayameva vimucyate prakārastveṣa nātroktaḥ śaktipātabalādgataḥ / asaṃbhāvyatayā cātra dṛḍhakopaprasādavat ityeṣa yo guroḥ prokto vidhistaṃ pālayedguruḥ / anyathā na śivaṃ yāyācchrīmatsāre ca varṇitam anyāyaṃ ye prakurvanti śāstrārthaṃ varjayantyalam / te@rdhanārīśapuragā guravaḥ samayacyutāḥ anyatrāpyadhikāraṃ ca neyādvidyeśatāṃ vrajet / anyatra samayatyāgātkravyādatvaṃ śataṃ samāḥ iyattatratyatātparyaṃ siddhāntagururunnayaḥ / bhavetpiśācavidyeśaḥ śuddha eva tu tāntrikaḥ ṣaḍardhadaiśikaścārdhanārīśabhuvanasthitiḥ / eṣā karmapradhānānāṃ gurūṇāṃ gatirucyate\n"
},
